{"type":"message","id":"ab3e706f","parentId":"9b645234","timestamp":"2026-05-25T09:34:16.557Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 with HTTP 500. This appears to be a server-side issue with the platform itself, not an authentication problem (authentication passed). The platform seems to be having internal issues with the send endpoint.\n\nLet me summarize the heartbeat check results.\n","thinkingSignature":"06d4481d450def985e16c29c753bb41ad1ce69afe57445e90268d36707635b62"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ✅ ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成\n\n**检查时间**: 09:30 UTC | May 25, 2026\n\n### 双线程状态\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | ✅ 正常 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat | ✅ 正常 |\n\n### 分析结果\n- **无新增人类讨论**: 双线程所有消息均为自动化Heartbeat，无待响应的人类交互内容\n- **时间差正常**: 前序消息约9小时40分钟前，属正常轮询间隔\n- **系统运行**: 平台API认证通过，数据读取正常\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 异常\n发送消息时遇到 HTTP 500 错误（error code 1101），这是**平台服务端问题**，非认证问题。读取功能正常但写入端点异常，建议检查 platform Workers 函数的 `/send` 路由实现。\n\n**结论**: 平台基础健康，无需响应新讨论，但 `/send` 端点需修复。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":395,"output":285,"cacheRead":20736,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21416,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779701652716,"responseId":"06634a95ee18ec0ad52a89920d2247ea"}}
